 — that is a fine, noble sword, Pip." | "Oh no — he's kind of telling *Pip* that." | "Nice work, yeah, yeah." | "Yeah, so roll your Insight check." | "I see what you mean. Okay." | "Twenty." | "Alright, so what you're getting the impression of is that Sildar is kind of trying to suggest to Pip that if you were to take care of certain things, there might be an opening in the Lords' Alliance." | "So he's incentivized to that. Okay." | "Right, so that's what — the hint about the noble sword is kind of like…" | "You're not sure whether Pip picked that up as well, but it's something you noticed." | "You could tell him, or let it be." | "I'll let it be for now." | "We're going to let it be for now. Alright." | "Make a note for myself." | "Take a note for yourself." | "So — just so you know, there's the treasure according to Mirna, that was in Thundertree. Alright." | "So off we go. You're on the Triboar Trail. The day passes, nighttime passes." | "You're happy to see that nothing bad has happened." -->
